          "_name": "video04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"video04\" group=\"Image & Video\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" plugins=\"PlayerVimeo\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"6\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"6\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Video\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" title=\"Image\">\n            <input type=\"color\" value=\"#000000\" title=\"Color\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\" title=\"Video\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0 mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Animistic Tech*</b></h4>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\"><i>A MINDSET FOR FUTURE TECH + Living Research Artifact , Exploring the Habituation Learning of the Roots and vegetal cognition , ROOTS DATA For a NEW IA Model.&nbsp;<br></i><b><br></b><br><b style>\"Inspired by ancestral animist cultures and their relationship with the environment for the creation of technologies, empowered in each context\"</b><br><b><br></b><br><br>Animistic Tech is a research project that explores the intersection between non-human intelligences, post-natural technologies, and bio procces, drawing inspiration from post-ancestral ecologies and cosmologies. It aims to develop a Roots Cognition IA Model* , a non-Western artificial intelligence model incorporating and learning from Vegetal cognition Research* , generating new technological languages and addressing current and future ecological crises in the era of post-anthropocene and post-capitalism. Living Research Artefact* is a device designed to observe and learn from Roots behavior interacting with soil, using cameras and sensors that respect soil darkness, allowing data collection without disturbing the natural environment. The purpose is to study root Habituation processes*, how they adapt and predict their environment, and use this data to feed the Roots Cognition IA Model, an AI based on Habituation Learning from Roots*. The artifact’s design allows natural and beneficial root-soil interaction, fostering life instead of control, and promoting growth in harmony with natural rhythms. The main objective is to better understand root languages and how they can inspire new technological paradigms, with an innovative and respectful approach to nature, reflecting love and respect instead of dominance.<div><b><br></b></div><div><b>For a Future Technology.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div></h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth}} video-block\">\n                <div mbr-video class=\"video-wrapper\">\n                    <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yhywh6d6-OY&loop=1&autoplay=1\"></iframe>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mt-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Harnessing ROOTS cognition for sustainable technology</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
